"No.{w}If anything, we are lower than livestock."{w}{p}"Sorcery is a Reading system of magic,
one that glimpses the power of the gods...
no, the very world of the gods."{w}{p}"The more one deciphers the knowledge, information and laws of the gods' world, the closer one can come, indirectly, to the thinking of the gods."{w}{p}"And the conclusion I reached from all that...{w}is that the gods have not prepared the land for our sake."{w}

"It seems they expect something to be born from this land,
or else to appear, or arise...
something of that sort."{w}{p}"Our being here is nothing more than a condition for that possibility."{w}

Before you, a number of eerie tentacles
brimming with baleful power
came dancing out.{w}
